# The Linux-only groups (simd and tmpfile*) are installed from this
# Makefile rather than ../Makefile.am, to keep each Makefile's list of
# distributed files short: automake's distdir rule passes the whole list to
# the shell as one argument, which Linux limits to 128 KiB.  The list below
# is regenerated by ../Makefile.am's regen target.

